    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Currently Supported Modes</h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1124680/extras/8bd77932918b819bec8e7b5047f93058.avif?t=1635560111\" /></div><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Volley, Soccer, and Hoops<br></li><li>Up to 4 versus 4</li></ul><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1124680/extras/ef3cba781ccbdac6e2739812a851135d.webp?t=1635560111\" /></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Equips make your slime bigger, faster, and stronger</h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1124680/extras/735e34a4001f59a05249478782121e66.avif?t=1635560111\" /></div><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Stats include Size, Jump Duration, Jump Power, Acceleration, Max Speed, and Nimbleness<br></li><li>There's also a standard mode available which makes all equips strictly cosmetic</li></ul><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1124680/extras/ef3cba781ccbdac6e2739812a851135d.webp?t=1635560111\" /></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Extreme Customization</h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1124680/extras/64c69f41b34df3eeaa9604a92f774d1b.poster.avif?t=1635560111\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1124680/extras/64c69f41b34df3eeaa9604a92f774d1b.webm?t=1635560111\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>4096 Possible Item color drops<br></li><li>Tons of unique faces, caps, and skins</li></ul><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1124680/extras/ef3cba781ccbdac6e2739812a851135d.webp?t=1635560111\" /></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Democratically Elect Rule Modifications</h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1124680/extras/7021c0d6440c0c0dfa05bf83fa59a545.avif?t=1635560111\" /></div><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Divide the court with a center wall to keep players on their side<br></li><li>Have a random ball size for each round in a match<br></li><li>Allow players to tumble and roll<br></li><li>And More!</li></ul><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1124680/extras/ef3cba781ccbdac6e2739812a851135d.webp?t=1635560111\" /></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Flash your fruit in RANKED PLAY as you advance to new mouthwatering divisions</h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1124680/extras/2aebbb26102bc5baefcde06d83a263ba.avif?t=1635560111\" /></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1124680/extras/ef3cba781ccbdac6e2739812a851135d.webp?t=1635560111\" /></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Item Color Level System</h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1124680/extras/a346f1b0c4c4a7156137e219ac85f7fc.avif?t=1635560111\" /></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1124680/extras/ef3cba781ccbdac6e2739812a851135d.webp?t=1635560111\" /></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Online Co-op Play with Friends</h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1124680/extras/squad.png?t=1635560111\" /></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1124680/extras/ef3cba781ccbdac6e2739812a851135d.webp?t=1635560111\" /></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">GamePad Support (360 Controller) </h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1124680/extras/fd6b100c568853fd033ffea5488bd5d0.avif?t=1635560111\" /></div><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> We currently provide very limited controller support. You can only controller your slime during a match, and with the 360 controller. We would like to eventually support custom key bindings and the ability to navigate the interface with the controller.</li></ul><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1124680/extras/ef3cba781ccbdac6e2739812a851135d.webp?t=1635560111\" /></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">What else?</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Achievements allow users to unlock exclusive new face equips<br></li><li>Watch Live Matches in real-time<br></li><li>Make bets and win gold pieces from other players<br></li><li>Buy items in the market with your match winnings</li></ul><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1124680/extras/ef3cba781ccbdac6e2739812a851135d.webp?t=1635560111\" /></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Frequently Asked Questions</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Why is Mac/Linux not supported?<br>Cross-platform builds and deployments take time we don't have to spare. For now, players on these platforms can access slime via a web browser.<br></li><li>Mobile Phone Play?<br>If we are successful enough to produce a mobile app we will do so. Trying to maintain feature parity with the desktop application was not productive.</li></ul>",
